import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 540 | Historical-Reversal Simulation | Wilderness Era World — Ecological Collapse of Predatory Cultivation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 540 | Historical-Reversal Simulation | Wilderness Era World — Ecological Collapse of Predatory Cultivation","no":540,"module":3,"tags":["Historical-Reversal Simulation","Wilderness Era","Predatory Cultivation","Ecological Collapse","Quest-Domain Simulation Review"],"related":["84-Archaeology Protocol General Outline","87-Knowledge-Only Return Principle","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","15-Energy-Cycle-and-Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0540_模块3-历史倒车模拟-莽荒世界-修仙掠夺的生态崩溃.md","filePath":"en/0540_模块3-历史倒车模拟-莽荒世界-修仙掠夺的生态崩溃.md"}'),o={name:"en/0540_模块3-历史倒车模拟-莽荒世界-修仙掠夺的生态崩溃.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,d){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-540-historical-reversal-simulation-wilderness-era-world-—-ecological-collapse-of-predatory-cultivation" tabindex="-1">Entry 540 | Historical-Reversal Simulation | Wilderness Era World — Ecological Collapse of Predatory Cultivation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-540-historical-reversal-simulation-wilderness-era-world-—-ecological-collapse-of-predatory-cultivation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 540 | Historical-Reversal Simulation | Wilderness Era World — Ecological Collapse of Predatory Cultivation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 84, 87, 04, 15</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-the-entire-plane-is-treated-as-a-furnace-to-tear-down-and-re-refine" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when the entire plane is treated as a furnace to tear down and re-refine <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-the-entire-plane-is-treated-as-a-furnace-to-tear-down-and-re-refine" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when the entire plane is treated as a furnace to tear down and re-refine&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Wilderness-style cultivation pushes &quot;seizing heaven-and-earth&#39;s creation&quot; to the extreme: spirit veins, cave-heavens, all-things&#39; origin can be taken for me; mighty ones open sky and earth by smashing the old and re-refining a batch. What reversal simulation must deduce is this &quot;predatory cultivation&quot;&#39;s time endpoint: <strong>when cultivators treat the entire plane&#39;s spiritual qi and ecosystem as infinitely mineable ore, along which direction does the plane itself slide on the time axis?</strong> It is the mirror of Douluo&#39;s &quot;hunting-ground theory&quot; — Douluo hunts sentient spirit beasts; Wilderness refines insentient heaven and earth, but structurally both eat stock.</p><p>Six top-level axioms run through the review: anti-predation axiom directly points to &quot;seizing heaven-and-earth&#39;s creation&quot; as predating the plane&#39;s stock, not developing increments; republican axiom of Myriad Races points out the myriad spirits nurtured by mountains, rivers, and spirit veins are not ownerless things; collective ascension axiom opposes &quot;one general&#39;s merit with ten thousand bones withered, one immortal&#39;s merit with ten thousand lands withered&quot;; causal self-discipline axiom constrains deduction to run only in Quest-Sediment-Domain sandboxes; law-first axiom requires the &quot;mine — deplete — ecological collapse — cultivation loses foundation&quot; energy causal chain defined first by law. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-layers-of-overdraw-in-predatory-cultivation" tabindex="-1">I. Three Layers of Overdraw in Predatory Cultivation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-layers-of-overdraw-in-predatory-cultivation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Layers of Overdraw in Predatory Cultivation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The sandbox restores three layers of overdraw in Wilderness-style cultivation:</p><ol><li><strong>Spirit-vein overdraw</strong>: top-grade spirit veins repeatedly extracted, severed; spiritual-qi density declines generation by generation; later generations&#39; cultivation start gets harder and harder.</li><li><strong>Cave-heaven overdraw</strong>: spiritual mountains and cave mansions occupied by mighty ones, enclosed as private property; ordinary cultivators have nowhere to go even for qi-rich places (the Great Dao occupied by kings).</li><li><strong>All-things-origin overdraw</strong>: alchemy and artifact refining directly extract heavenly treasures&#39; origin; the ecological chain shrinks synchronously on the three layers of &quot;medicine field — spirit beast — spirit vein.&quot;</li></ol><p>Three layers stacked; cultivation civilization seems strong ones emerge one after another, but actually makes the plane underfoot thinner and thinner.</p><h2 id="ii-ecological-collapse-curve-the-trilogy-of-qi-decline" tabindex="-1">II. Ecological Collapse Curve: The Trilogy of Qi Decline <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-ecological-collapse-curve-the-trilogy-of-qi-decline" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Ecological Collapse Curve: The Trilogy of Qi Decline&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The sandbox deduces the civilization curve after spiritual-qi density falls below the cultivation threshold:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Curve</th><th>Stage</th><th>Reversal Signs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>I</td><td>Spirit veins depleted</td><td>High-tier veins successively go silent; mighty ones go out &quot;to seek other treasure lands&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>II</td><td>Cultivation generation-break</td><td>Native spiritual qi insufficient; new generations cannot even enter; native cultivation civilization shrinks</td></tr><tr><td>III</td><td>Plane barren</td><td>Lost spiritual nourishment; mountains wither, all things fade; once-cultivation holy lands become wasteland</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Most worth reviewing is Stage I&#39;s &quot;go out seeking other treasure lands&quot;: after a plane is squeezed dry, predators do not reflect on structure, but replicate predatory means onto the next plane — this is precisely the time origin of cross-plane predatory colonization. <strong>While reversing on its own plane, it sows reversal seeds onto more planes.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-control-experiment-life-cycle-system-s-incremental-spirit-nourishing" tabindex="-1">III. Control Experiment: Life-Cycle System&#39;s Incremental Spirit-Nourishing <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-control-experiment-life-cycle-system-s-incremental-spirit-nourishing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Control Experiment: Life-Cycle System&#39;s Incremental Spirit-Nourishing&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The sandbox ran a key control: replace predatory mining with the Life-Cycle System (second Origin system) — spiritual qi is no longer extracted, but regarded as recyclable, renewable public resource; through the symbiotic network&#39;s incremental development, continuously nourish veins, nurture spirits, protect ecosystems. Result:</p><ul><li>Spirit veins get richer the more used; cave-heavens open to all beings (all-level Great-Dao openness);</li><li>Cultivators symbiotic with ecosystems; alchemy and artifact refining use artificial synthesis to replace predating origins;</li><li>Plane spiritual-qi density steadily rises; native new generations have roads to cultivate.</li></ul><p>The control proves: <strong>the root of Wilderness-style collapse is not &quot;heaven-earth spiritual qi is finite,&quot; but treating spiritual qi as stock to be robbed, not nourished.</strong> Nourished spiritual qi is inexhaustible; robbed spiritual qi empties the more it is robbed.</p><h2 id="iv-review-results-three-nourish-take-balance-indicators" tabindex="-1">IV. Review Results: Three Nourish-Take Balance Indicators <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-review-results-three-nourish-take-balance-indicators" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Review Results: Three Nourish-Take Balance Indicators&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Spirit-vein regeneration-rate indicator</strong>: monitor this civilization&#39;s spiritual-qi consumption vs regeneration ratio; long-term consumption greater than regeneration triggers warning.</li><li><strong>Cave-heaven openness indicator</strong>: monitor whether spiritual mountains and cave mansions are enclosed as private property by a few mighty ones; maintain Great-Dao openness.</li><li><strong>Ecological coupling indicator</strong>: monitor whether alchemy and artifact refining destroy ecosystems as raw material; mandate shift to artificial-synthesis incremental paths.</li></ul><p>Three indicators connected to the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision reversal dashboard. All knowledge comes from isolated sandboxes, following the &quot;Knowledge-Only Return Principle.&quot;</p><p>The sandbox also recorded a secondary consequence often ignored: after spirit veins deplete, what first withers is not mighty ones, but the low-tier beings living off mountain spiritual qi — insects, grasses, mountain sprites. No one speaks for them; they quietly vanish; by the time mighty ones notice below the mountain is barren, it is long past remedy. This observation is written as an ecological-ethics principle: <strong>to see whether a cultivation civilization is healthy, do not look at how many mighty ones it has, but look at whether the low-tier beings under its feet are faring well.</strong> Civilization&#39;s confidence lies precisely in the most inconspicuous places.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: treating a whole plane as a furnace to re-refine is the ultimate waste of cosmic-scale ecology — ore dug empty, not even reconstruction capital left</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: &quot;seizing heaven-and-earth&#39;s creation&quot; is stock predation wrapped in immortal glamour; the sandbox proves it inevitably leads to plane-level ecological collapse</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Wilderness is more &quot;grand&quot; than Tang Luo and Douluo, but cannot escape the fate of eating stock; Heng Yuan Zhou uses the Life-Cycle System to swap fuel at the root</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the review brings plant spirits and planet consciousness nurtured by mountains and rivers into symbiotic accounting, opposing treating heaven and earth as private property</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: qi-decline trilogy, three nourish-take balance indicators openly filed, for all cultivation planes&#39; self-check</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Wilderness Era&#39;s reversal simulation tells all cultivation civilizations: the premise that you can &quot;seize heaven-and-earth&#39;s creation&quot; today is that tomorrow there is still heaven-and-earth for you to seize. Cultivators who dig the plane underfoot as a mine will eventually find themselves standing at the bottom of the pit they dug. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is not &quot;cultivation forbidden,&quot; but use the Life-Cycle System to replace predatory mining with incremental nourishing — making spirit veins richer the more cultivated, cave-heavens wider the more opened; cultivation&#39;s endpoint is not a barren wasteland, but a lifted, nurtured, endlessly living Myriad-Rank home.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./84-考古协议总纲.html">84-Archaeology Protocol General Outline</a> · <a href="./87-仅回传知识原则.html">87-Knowledge-Only Return Principle</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy-Cycle-and-Transformation Law</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
